OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving mum's plea after thieves
OL,4,Atarget baby's grave
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose daughter died when she
OL,7,Fwas 36 weeks pregnant has said she is
OL,8,F"hurting a lot" after thieves targeted
OL,9,Fher child's grave twice.
OL,11,FCourteney Alikhan said figures had been
OL,12,Ftaken from the grave at Canley
OL,13,FCrematorium, Coventry, prompting her to
OL,14,Flaunch a petition for improved security
OL,15,Fat council-managed cemeteries and
OL,16,Fcrematoriums, including CCTV at entry
OL,17,Fand exit points.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
