OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving mum's plea after thieves
OL,4,Atarget baby's grave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has pledged to strengthen
OL,7,Fsecurity but stopped short of
OL,8,Fcommitting to CCTV, saying it would not
OL,9,Fbe "practical or proportionate". It
OL,10,Falso urged families to report suspected
OL,11,Fthefts or vandalism to police.
OL,13,FAlikhan said the decision was
OL,14,Fdisappointing and believes the council
OL,15,Fis "allowing the problem to continue".
